{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_8","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc 'rtk read /Users/yousefallaban/.codex/plugins/cache/yousefallaban/scrubjay/0.1.0/skills/docs-conventions/assets/architecture/stack.md /Users/yousefallaban/.codex/plugins/cache/yousefallaban/scrubjay/0.1.0/skills/docs-conventions/assets/architecture/boundaries.md /Users/yousefallaban/.codex/plugins/cache/yousefallaban/scrubjay/0.1.0/skills/docs-conventions/assets/architecture/data-model.md /Users/yousefallaban/.codex/plugins/cache/yousefallaban/scrubjay/0.1.0/skills/docs-conventions/assets/architecture/contracts.md /Users/yousefallaban/.codex/plugins/cache/yousefallaban/scrubjay/0.1.0/skills/docs-conventions/assets/architecture/integrations.md /Users/yousefallaban/.codex/plugins/cache/yousefallaban/scrubjay/0.1.0/skills/docs-conventions/assets/architecture/config.md /Users/yousefallaban/.codex/plugins/cache/yousefallaban/scrubjay/0.1.0/skills/docs-conventions/assets/architecture/invariants.md'","aggregated_output":"---\narea: stack\n---\n# Stack\n\n<!-- Current state only. The why lives in decision records.\ndocs-init writes Commands. docs-map adds Languages and frameworks when a domain needs it. -->\n\n## Languages and frameworks\n<!-- optional until docs-map fills it -->\n| Name | Version | Used for |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| {{name}} | {{version}} | {{what it's used for}} |\n\n## Commands\n<!-- spec-build and spec-ship run these, so keep them exact. Delete a row the project has no command for. -->\n| Task | Command |\n| --- | --- |\n| Install | {{command}} |\n| Run | {{command}} |\n| Test | {{command}} |\n| Lint | {{command}} |\n| Build | {{command}} |\n---\narea: boundaries\n---\n# Boundaries\n\n<!-- Which code belongs to which domain, and what each module may depend on. -->\n| Module | Path | Domain | May depend on |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| {{module}} | {{path}} | {{domain}} | {{modules}} |\n---\narea: data-model\n---\n# Data model\n\n<!-- Current state only. The why lives in decision records. -->\n| Entity | Key fields | Relations |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| {{entity}} | {{fields}} | {{relations}} |\n---\narea: contracts\n---\n# Contracts\n\n<!-- APIs and events other code depends on. Current state only. -->\n| Name | Kind | Input | Output | Consumers |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| {{name}} | {{API or event}} | {{input}} | {{output}} | {{who uses it}} |\n---\narea: integrations\n---\n# Integrations\n\n<!-- External services. \"When it fails\" is the column agents most often need. -->\n| Service | Purpose | Direction | Auth | When it fails |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| {{service}} | {{purpose}} | {{in, out or both}} | {{how}} | {{what the product does}} |\n---\narea: config\n---\n# Config\n\n<!-- Settings and feature flags. Never real secret values. -->\n| Setting | Purpose | Default | Where it's set |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| {{name}} | {{purpose}} | {{default}} | {{env var, file or service}} |\n---\narea: invariants\n---\n# Invariants\n\n<!-- Non-negotiable rules every spec must keep. Company policies (security, privacy) are linked from index.md, not copied here. -->\n| ID | Rule | Why |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| {{inv-id}} | {{the rule}} | {{why it can't be broken}} |\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
